# Mosquitto ACL for the secure profile. Default is deny: anything not granted
# here is refused (publishes are dropped, subscriptions are not delivered).

# Ingest service: reads every device's telemetry and status, and owns the
# alert tree (it publishes alert state and reads it back after a restart).
user ingest
topic read sensors/+/telemetry
topic read sensors/+/status
topic readwrite alerts/#

# Optional read-only observer account for debugging with mosquitto_sub.
user monitor
topic read sensors/#
topic read alerts/#

# Devices: the MQTT username is the device id (%u), and a device may only
# publish its own telemetry and status (including its last-will message).
# A compromised sensor therefore cannot inject data for any other device.
pattern write sensors/%u/telemetry
pattern write sensors/%u/status
